{"language": "html", "code": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Core Pure Revision — Edexcel 9FM0</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,400&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Source+Serif+4:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg:        #0e0e1a;
    --surface:   #16162a;
    --card:      #1c1c32;
    --border:    #2a2a48;
    --text:      #e0d8c8;
    --muted:     #7a7290;
    --gold:      #d4a843;
    --gold-dim:  #9a7a2f;
    --red:       #e05c70;
    --teal:      #3ecfb8;
    --blue:      #5b9cf6;
    --purple:    #9b7fe8;
    --green:     #5ec97a;
    --HIGH:      #e05c70;
    --MEDIUM:    #d4a843;
    --LOW:       #5b9cf6;
    --REVIEW:    #9b7fe8;
    --NEVER:     #ff6b6b;
    --Easy:      #5ec97a;
    --Medium:    #d4a843;
    --Hard:      #e07545;
    --VeryHard:  #e05c70;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(14,14,26,0.96);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .nav-brand {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-right: 2rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 0;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .nav-tabs { display: flex; gap: 0; }
  .nav-tab {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: color .2s, border-color .2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }
  .nav-tab:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .nav-tab.active { color: var(--gold); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }

  /* ── MAIN ── */
  main { flex: 1; }
  .section { display: none; padding: 2.5rem 2rem 4rem; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section.active { display: block; }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(212,168,67,0.08) 0%, transparent 65%);
  }
  .hero-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .hero-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  /* ── STAT CARDS ── */
  .stat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .stat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.2rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .stat-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

  /* ── ALERT BOXES ── */
  .alert {
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    border-left: 4px solid;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .alert-danger { background: rgba(224,92,112,0.1); border-color: var(--red); }
  .alert-warning { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.1); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .alert-info { background: rgba(155,127,232,0.1); border-color: var(--purple); }
  .alert strong { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.85rem; }

  /* ── SECTION TITLES ── */
  h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .section-desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 1.8rem; }
  .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin: 2rem 0; }

  /* ── FILTERS ── */
  .filter-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .filter-bar input {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    outline: none;
    min-width: 220px;
    transition: border-color .2s;
  }
  .filter-bar input:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
  .filter-bar input::placeholder { color: var(--muted); }

  .chip-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .chip {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted);
    border-radius: 99px;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.85rem;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all .15s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .chip:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--text); }
  .chip.on { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); color: #000; font-weight: 500; }
  .chip.on-HIGH { background: var(--HIGH); border-color: var(--HIGH); color: #fff; }
  .chip.on-MEDIUM { background: var(--MEDIUM); border-color: var(--MEDIUM); color: #000; }
  .chip.on-LOW { background: var(--LOW); border-color: var(--LOW); color: #fff; }
  .chip.on-REVIEW { background: var(--REVIEW); border-color: var(--REVIEW); color: #fff; }
  .chip.on-NEVER { background: var(--NEVER); border-color: var(--NEVER); color: #fff; }

  /* ── TABLE ── */
  .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.84rem; }
  thead th {
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    position: relative;
  }
  thead th:hover { color: var(--text); }
  thead th::after { content: ' ⇅'; opacity: 0.3; }
  thead th.sort-asc::after { content: ' ↑'; opacity: 1; color: var(--gold); }
  thead th.sort-desc::after { content: ' ↓'; opacity: 1; color: var(--gold); }
  tbody tr {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,42,72,0.5);
    transition: background .12s;
  }
  tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.04); }
  tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  td { padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem; vertical-align: middle; }
  .no-results { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); padding: 2.5rem; font-style: italic; }

  /* ── BADGES ── */
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.18em 0.55em;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .badge-HIGH   { background: rgba(224,92,112,0.18); color: var(--HIGH); border: 1px solid rgba(224,92,112,0.3); }
  .badge-MEDIUM { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.18); color: var(--MEDIUM); border: 1px solid rgba(212,168,67,0.3); }
  .badge-LOW    { background: rgba(91,156,246,0.18); color: var(--LOW); border: 1px solid rgba(91,156,246,0.3); }
  .badge-REVIEW { background: rgba(155,127,232,0.18); color: var(--REVIEW); border: 1px solid rgba(155,127,232,0.3); }
  .badge-NEVER  { background: rgba(255,107,107,0.18); color: var(--NEVER); border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,107,0.3); }

  .diff-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.18em 0.55em;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.63rem;
  }
  .diff-Easy     { background: rgba(94,201,122,0.15); color: var(--Easy); }
  .diff-Medium   { background: rgba(212,168,67,0.15); color: var(--Medium); }
  .diff-Hard     { background: rgba(224,117,69,0.15); color: var(--Hard); }
  .diff-VeryHard { background: rgba(224,92,112,0.15); color: var(--VeryHard); }
  .diff-Unknown  { background: rgba(122,114,144,0.15); color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── MARK BAR ── */
  .mark-bar-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; min-width: 90px; }
  .mark-bar-bg { flex: 1; height: 4px; background: var(--border); border-radius: 2px; min-width: 50px; }
  .mark-bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--gold); }
  .mark-num { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text); min-width: 28px; }

  /* ── TOPIC TEXT ── */
  .topic-text { max-width: 340px; }
  .chapter-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }
  td.chapter-cell { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; white-space: nowrap; }
  .apps-cell { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: center; }

  /* ── COUNT INDICATOR ── */
  .result-count {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }
  .result-count span { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ── TECHNIQUES ACCORDION ── */
  .technique-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .technique-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--card);
    transition: background .15s;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .technique-header:hover { background: var(--surface); }
  .technique-name { font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.9rem; flex: 1; }
  .technique-count {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .technique-arrow { color: var(--muted); transition: transform .2s; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .technique-item.open .technique-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .technique-body {
    display: none;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 0.87rem;
  }
  .technique-item.open .technique-body { display: block; }
  .technique-examples { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }

  /* ── DIFFICULTY CHART ── */
  .diff-chart { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.7rem; max-width: 520px; }
  .diff-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.9rem; }
  .diff-label { width: 80px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .diff-bar-bg { flex: 1; height: 28px; background: var(--card); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .diff-bar { height: 100%; border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-left: 0.7rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: #000; transition: width 0.8s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1); }
  .diff-pct { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); width: 38px; text-align: right; }

  /* ── CP1/CP2 COMPARISON ── */
  .cp-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .cp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .cp-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
  }
  .cp-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .cp-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,42,72,0.4);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
  }
  .cp-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cp-item-topic { flex: 1; color: var(--text); }
  .cp-item-marks { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gold); white-space: nowrap; }
  .cp-item-apps { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }

  /* ── RECOMMENDATIONS ── */
  .rec-group { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .rec-group h3 { margin-top: 0; }
  .checklist { list-style: none; }
  .checklist li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.55rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(42,42,72,0.4);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .checklist li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .checklist li input[type="checkbox"] { display: none; }
  .check-box {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all .15s;
  }
  .checklist li.done .check-box { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .checklist li.done .check-box::after { content: '✓'; font-size: 11px; color: #000; }
  .checklist li.done .check-text { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--muted); }
  .check-text { flex: 1; }

  /* ── NEVER TESTED TABLE ── */
  .never-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .never-card {
    background: rgba(255,107,107,0.07);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,107,0.3);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
  }
  .never-card .tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--NEVER); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .never-card .title { font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .never-card .spec { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .never-card .note { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; }

  /* ── PRIORITY LEGEND ── */
  .priority-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .leg-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .leg-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── INSIGHTS BOX ── */
  .insight-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .insight-box h4 { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .insight-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.45rem; }
  .insight-list li { font-size: 0.87rem; padding-left: 1.1rem; position: relative; }
  .insight-list li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }

  /* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius: 3px; }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    nav { padding: 0 0.8rem; }
    .section { padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem; }
    .stat-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-label">Edexcel A-Level Further Mathematics · 9FM0</div>
  <h1>Core Pure Revision Report</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Papers 1 &amp; 2 · 16 papers analysed · 2019–2025 inc. samples</p>
  <div class="stat-grid">
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">16</div><div class="stat-label">Papers analysed</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">152</div><div class="stat-label">Question parts tagged</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">81</div><div class="stat-label">Knowledge points</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">1,200</div><div class="stat-label">Total marks in dataset</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">54%</div><div class="stat-label">Hard or very hard</div></div>
    <div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-num">2</div><div class="stat-label">Topics never tested</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-brand">9FM0 Core Pure</div>
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="nav-tab active" data-tab="overview">Overview</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="matrix">Priority Matrix</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="techniques">Hidden Techniques</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="difficulty">Difficulty</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="papers">CP1 vs CP2</button>
    <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="recs">Recommendations</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- ══════════ OVERVIEW ══════════ -->
<section id="tab-overview" class="section active">
  <h2>Overview</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">Key patterns from the full audit of CP1 and CP2 papers, 2019–2025.</p>

  <div class="alert alert-danger">
    <strong>⚠ NEVER TESTED (2 topics)</strong> — These are in the specification but have never appeared on any past paper. They could surprise you.
  </div>

  <div class="never-grid">
    <div class="never-card">
      <div class="tag">Never Appeared · Spec 3.3</div>
      <div class="title">Represent and use 3×3 matrices for 3D transformations</div>
      <div class="spec">Chapter: Matrices</div>
      <div class="note">Could appear as a 3D extension question — familiar 2D method applied in a new context.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="never-card">
      <div class="tag">Never Appeared · Spec 2.9</div>
      <div class="title">Express complex numbers in Euler exponential form z = re<sup>iθ</sup></div>
      <div class="spec">Chapter: Complex Numbers</div>
      <div class="note">Could combine with De Moivre's theorem or roots of unity. Worth a quick review.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-warning">
    <strong>ℹ Marks-weighted totals overlap.</strong> A 10-mark question tagged to multiple skills attaches those 10 marks to each skill. Read mark totals as importance signals, not isolated subtotals.
  </div>

  <hr class="divider">
  <h3>Top 10 Most Tested Topics</h3>
  <p class="section-desc">Sorted by total marks attached. These dominate the exam.</p>

  <div class="table-wrap" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
    <table id="top10-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Topic</th>
          <th>Chapter</th>
          <th>Apps</th>
          <th>Marks</th>
          <th>Difficulty</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="top10-body"></tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="insight-box">
    <h4>Key Insights</h4>
    <ul class="insight-list">
      <li>DE model realism (t→∞ check) has the most marks (249) but is always a <em>secondary</em> skill — it's the judgement step at the end of modelling questions.</li>
      <li>Coupled simultaneous DEs has only 5 appearances but 81 marks — when it comes up, it dominates the question.</li>
      <li>De Moivre for integer powers (12 apps, 83 marks) is the most frequent topic and often accessible. Don't neglect it.</li>
      <li>83 of 152 tagged entries are Hard or Very Hard — Core Pure requires multi-step reasoning, not just recall.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

